{
    "key": "fitness-trainer",
    "templateKey": "repobot-fitness-trainer",
    "title": "Personal Trainer",
    "description": "A strength coach's personal-brand site in the monolith register — true black ground, monumental type with the closing word stroke-only, hairline rules, zero color — with one continuous single-hard-light photo shoot carrying all the atmosphere: a live training-week schedule computed from one content file (today marked, a 'Next session / In session' badge derived from the clock), the coach's bio with credentials, three coaching programs as pricing tiers, an apply-to-train process timeline, and a free-consult application form. Four pages, all edited in a single content file.",
    "marketingExampleTitle": "Personal trainer site",
    "category": "fitness",
    "homePath": "/",
    "previewPath": "/trainer",
    "homeViewDir": "web/app/src/View/FitnessTrainer",
    "base": "landing",
    "clientOnly": true,
    "capabilities": ["IOS", "ANDROID"],
    "isDefault": false,
    "theme": {
        "$comment": "The monolith register's overlay: mode dark opens the site on true black (the appearance toggle still swaps to the gallery-white negative), and the register's ink accents ride as the project brand so app-side surfaces wear the same monochrome register as the marketing pages instead of the kernel default blue. Brand values match monolith's own light/dark accents — the marketing pages resolve brand over preset accent, so keeping them identical means the overlay re-brands the app without shifting the pages. There is no color anywhere; the photography is the only atmosphere.",
        "mode": "dark",
        "brand": {
            "primary": "#0a0a0a",
            "primaryDark": "#ffffff"
        }
    },
    "contentContract": {
        "$comment": "The pack's content slots, as data (packs/README.md 'Content contract'). Declares what a composer (agent or tool) must bind for a generated variant of this pack to present as real: slot paths into the typed content module, their kinds, and minimums. Authored alongside the module and guarded by the pack's content tests — the module satisfies the contract; the contract never drifts ahead of it. The training week is the signature slot: day/start/end are NUMBERS (weekday index and minutes since midnight) that the schedule engine computes the live badge and the day rows from — a composer must bind them as numbers, never prose.",
        "module": "web/app/src/View/FitnessTrainer/content.ts",
        "slots": {
            "trainer.name": { "kind": "text" },
            "trainer.brand": { "kind": "text" },
            "trainer.tagline": { "kind": "text" },
            "trainer.city": { "kind": "text" },
            "trainer.address": { "kind": "text" },
            "trainer.phone": { "kind": "text" },
            "trainer.email": { "kind": "text" },
            "trainingWeek": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 6,
                "item": {
                    "day": { "kind": "number" },
                    "start": { "kind": "number" },
                    "end": { "kind": "number" },
                    "title": { "kind": "text" },
                    "instructor": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "bio.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "bio.paragraphs": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 2 },
            "bio.credentials": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 2 },
            "bio.portrait": { "kind": "media" },
            "stats": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 3,
                "item": {
                    "value": { "kind": "text" },
                    "label": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "programs": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 2,
                "item": {
                    "name": { "kind": "text" },
                    "monthly": { "kind": "number" },
                    "yearlyPerMonth": { "kind": "number" },
                    "description": { "kind": "text" },
                    "features": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 3 }
                }
            },
            "process": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 3,
                "item": {
                    "title": { "kind": "text" },
                    "description": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "faq": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 3,
                "item": {
                    "question": { "kind": "text" },
                    "answer": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "testimonials": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 1,
                "item": {
                    "quote": { "kind": "text" },
                    "name": { "kind": "text" },
                    "detail": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "home.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.subheadline": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.hero": { "kind": "media" },
            "gallery": { "kind": "media[]", "min": 3 },
            "consult.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "consult.body": { "kind": "text" }
        }
    },
